{#-
  A cue, as an actor is sent it (procreator/actor.ts): who they are now, when that changed since
  they were last told; the scene, when it's new to them; then what they see, hear and know now,
  in Procreator's words. When the owner played them this time, it ends with what they did, and
  nothing is asked. Takes news (a rendered actor/self.njk, or empty), scene (number, place and
  time, or null), sees and did (or empty).
-#}
<cue>
{% if news %}
<you_now>
Who you are has changed since you were last told. This is who you are now:
{{ news }}
</you_now>
{% endif %}
{% if scene %}
<scene number="{{ scene.number }}"{% if scene.place %} where="{{ scene.place }}"{% endif %}{% if scene.time %} when="{{ scene.time }}"{% endif %}/>
{% endif %}
{{ sees }}
</cue>
{% if did %}
<played>
{{ did }}
</played>
{% endif %}
